    {
      "zh-CN": "从上面泼水只能浇到表面，火会在里面接着烧。",
      "en": "Splashing water from above only wets the surface; the fire keeps burning inside."
    },
    {
      "zh-CN": "把整个地窖灌满，让水漫过燃烧的木箱，火就没有空气了。",
      "en": "Fill the whole cellar so the water covers the burning crates and the fire has no air."
    },
    {
      "zh-CN": "火一着就在进水口正上方画两道粗水柱，一共一百八十格左右。",
      "en": "As soon as the fire starts, draw two thick columns of water right above the hole, about 180 cells in all."
    }
